sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Khách hàng / Public Client
    participant Ctrl as PublicVendorController<br/>(/api/vendors)
    participant VendorUC as GetPublicVendorProfileUseCase
    participant SvcUC as SearchServicesUseCase
    participant VendorRepo as JpaVendorRepository
    participant SvcPort as VendorActiveServicesPort
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Note over Client, DB: Luồng Hồ Sơ & Cửa Hàng Đối Tác Công Khai (R3)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client, DB: Nhánh 1: Truy vấn hồ sơ công khai của Vendor
        Client->>Ctrl: GET /api/vendors/{id}
        activate Ctrl
        Ctrl->>VendorUC: execute(vendorId)
        activate VendorUC

        VendorUC->>VendorRepo: findById(vendorId)
        activate VendorRepo
        VendorRepo->>DB: SELECT * FROM vendors WHERE id = ?
        DB-->>VendorRepo: VendorEntity (hoặc empty)
        deactivate VendorRepo

        alt Không tìm thấy Vendor
            VendorUC-->>Ctrl: VendorNotFoundException
            Ctrl-->>Client: 404 Not Found
        end

        VendorUC->>SvcPort: countActiveServicesByVendorId(vendorId)
        activate SvcPort
        SvcPort->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM services WHERE vendor_id = ? AND status = 'PUBLISHED'
        DB-->>SvcPort: activeServicesCount
        deactivate SvcPort

        Note over VendorUC: Tạo PublicVendorResponse:<br/>• id, businessName, address, avatarUrl<br/>• badgeTier, ratingAvg, ratingCount<br/>• activeServicesCount<br/>(Cách ly hoàn toàn khỏi bank account, tax ID)

        VendorUC-->>Ctrl: PublicVendorResponse
        deactivate VendorUC
        Ctrl-->>Client: 200 OK (PublicVendorResponse)
        deactivate Ctrl
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
        Note over Client, DB: Nhánh 2: Truy vấn danh mục dịch vụ tại cửa hàng Vendor (Storefront)
        Client->>Ctrl: GET /api/vendors/{id}/services?sortBy=price_asc&page=0&size=20
        activate Ctrl
        
        Note over Ctrl: Kiểm tra Vendor có tồn tại trước (fail-fast 404 nếu không tìm thấy)
        Ctrl->>VendorUC: execute(vendorId)

        Ctrl->>SvcUC: execute(SearchServicesCriteria.builder().vendorId(id)...)
        activate SvcUC
        SvcUC->>DB: SELECT * FROM services WHERE vendor_id = ? AND status = 'PUBLISHED' ORDER BY ...
        DB-->>SvcUC: List<ServiceEntity>
        deactivate SvcUC

        Ctrl-->>Client: 200 OK (PageResponse<ServiceSummaryResponse>)
        deactivate Ctrl
    end
